      "content": "it just feels like no matter how much i fight, the world is designed to make me feel like an outsider. i'm just so exhausted by the constant effort of protecting myself. sometimes i think maybe the only way to actually be at peace is to just stop. like, if i didn't have to exist in this version of society, everything would just be quiet.",
