    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not that i want to \"get help\" to feel better, it's just that the help feels like more work. more talking, more explaining, more fighting just to be understood. it feels like a cycle that never ends. sometimes it feels less like a struggle and more like a debt i just can't afford to keep paying. don't you think it's just... a lot? like, is it really so wrong to want it all to just be over?",
